    "Id": "chassisdef_griffin_GRF-C",
    "Name": "Griffin",
    "Details": "A refit fielded by the Wolf Empire and sold by the Sea Foxes, the Griffin C is a standardised refit package designed to bring captured Inner Sphere Griffins up to Clan spec. Swapping the standard 275 core for a 330-rated one significantly improves the ground speed and allows for the installation of 9 Improved Jump Jets; virtually doubling the mechs jump range. Swamping the standard PPC for a clan spec ER alternative and the LRM rack for a smaller Streak 10 allows the Griffin to strike at almost any range. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Battle Fists</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
